   110	## 8. Failure modes + rollback
   111	
   112	DB projection failure for one target: rollback that target's savepoint, mark `failed`, continue other targets, commit claim. A synthetic trigger failure on `entity_assessment` must still leave `accounts_columns` and `success_plans` committed with their own status rows.
