   114	
   115	Wave merge-gate artifact: `cargo test --test harness`, `cargo test --test eval_fixture_governance`, `scripts/check_eval_fixture_anonymization.sh`, and a `target/eval/harness-report.json` CI artifact showing Bundle 1 and Bundle 5 coverage, tracked/non-blocking bundles 2-4/6-8, fixture counts by ability/category/label, runtime, and regression-class counts. Suite S contribution: PII/no-network/revoked-source evidence. Suite P contribution: parallel run timing under 60s. Suite E contribution: Bundle 1 cross-entity/same-domain coverage and Bundle 5 correction-resurrection coverage.
